<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Jim Poyner increased the 1997 earnings estimate for Intel Corp to $8.30 per share from $7.85, his office said.</p>
<p>-- raised the 12-month price target to $160 per share from $150.</p>
<p>-- reiterated the buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 2-1/8 to 139.</p>
</text>
